{"title":"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 27","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Pi_Academy\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Pi Academy</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c3a2d2224f7d163b46d702132425d47828bf538.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> is on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/7/a179ff2638e4799cadd820db205c2beff6299ce9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/5/a055f405829e64a3b70253ab67cb45ed6ed5bb29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> is on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/5/6c52a41dcbd739f1d026c5d4f181438b75b76976.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" />. Also, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/c/54cc600e467e604ca674d41d7681061b996d810f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB\\perp AC$\" width=\"80\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/f/43fabf553c742a08accf98a3daf367f8ccaa98a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AF\\perp BC$\" width=\"81\" height=\"13\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/c/5bc919435bbae8df6c983395eaaae18a38ccf5af.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BD=DC=FC=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"169\" height=\"13\" />. Find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/7/a179ff2638e4799cadd820db205c2beff6299ce9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/1/8c16b48b41b5bd7f7d40d85135d6c79721168ef0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ }\\sqrt{2} \\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ }\\sqrt{3} \\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\ } \\sqrt[3]{2} \\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\ }\\sqrt[3]{3} \\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\ } \\sqrt[4]{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"420\" height=\"21\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/1/0f19370b70e8106e0b3219a006c2af6d773613f6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] unitsize(4cm); draw((0,0)--(2^(1/3),0)); draw((0,0)--(0,16^(1/3)-4^(1/3))); draw((2^(1/3),0)--(0,16^(1/3)-4^(1/3))); draw((0,16^(1/3)-4^(1/3))--(2^(1/3)-1,0)); draw((0,0)--(0.445861,0.602489)); label(&quot;$A$&quot;,(0,0),W); label(&quot;$B$&quot;,(0,16^(1/3)-4^(1/3)),N); label(&quot;$C$&quot;,(2^(1/3),0),E); label(&quot;$D$&quot;,(2^(1/3)-1,0),SE); label(&quot;$F$&quot;,(0.445861,0.602489),NE); label(&quot;$1$&quot;,((2^(1/3)+.445861)/2,.602489/2),NE); label(&quot;$1$&quot;,(2^(1/3)-.5,0),S); label(&quot;$1$&quot;, (.13, .932441/2), NE);  label(&quot;$x-1$&quot;,(.13,0),S); label(&quot;$\\sqrt{2x-x^2}$&quot;,(0,.932441/2),W); label(&quot;$y$&quot;,(.445861/2,(.932441+.602489)/2),NE); label(&quot;$\\sqrt{y}$&quot;,(.445861/2,.602489/2),E); [/asy]\" width=\"352\" height=\"222\" />\n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/4/2345cf4f7dddab7e3fbb69f1266183fce6d5d1be.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC=x$\" width=\"62\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/0/e204500cbf06f5a476cfaa66daaf7d410f091b93.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BF=y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"62\" height=\"16\" />. We have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/7/5d7750410a06b5ca96c23e4eb28c8bcc23ece8e7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AFC\\sim BFA$\" width=\"109\" height=\"13\" /> by AA, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/7/af78513733aae9ea4327a1fdb98945b741ad201d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{AF}{FC}=\\frac{BF}{AF}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"91\" height=\"39\" />. Substituting in known values gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/e/71e2ea4d0e6e53bf6076d9c1f514a9ee8c72fc00.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{AF}{1}=\\frac{y}{AF}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"86\" height=\"38\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/9/4c9f414beedb7a58137ddd9e5473f6a0dd5a07ac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AF=\\sqrt{y}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"77\" height=\"18\" />. Also, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/6/1f68f41f7e2cfdbf342edc9e73a6cf9ae0c918cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD=x-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"94\" height=\"13\" />, and using the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Pythagorean_Theorem\" title=\"Pythagorean Theorem\">Pythagorean Theorem</a> on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/5/f75d6d58b03031bd7cb52a7ca886a8ddf369d21c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/6/556deed06e53ab0b38228eaf3f9c3fbcf680a5fc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB^2+(x-1)^2=1^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"160\" height=\"19\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/f/e3fd272b1e579b6ad848f4081cce29b39ba63191.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB=\\sqrt{2x-x^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"127\" height=\"18\" />. Using the Pythagorean Theorem on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/3/26309a54f2290339ca07fe471c7e8d85e868bbc0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle AFC$\" width=\"58\" height=\"13\" /> gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/1/3c131c886c2ee7cd65be7f4d8ea245b7b2bc32b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y+1=x^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"81\" height=\"18\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/e/3decd1f35a7d7c34e4729c267a57c032578cdbb1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=x^2-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"82\" height=\"18\" />. Now, we use the Pythagorean Theorem on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/d/97d59b1384670dfc0b60fb9b4f6610e37e3f8c18.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle AFB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" /> to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/1/6711465b1d0e5acd0902b2d692fe862ba29ab4f0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y^2+y=2x-x^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"131\" height=\"18\" />. Substituting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/e/3decd1f35a7d7c34e4729c267a57c032578cdbb1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=x^2-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"82\" height=\"18\" /> into this gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/8/228601f7df323d4b546acb28864282f059ba793a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x^2-1)^2+x^2-1=2x-x^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"224\" height=\"19\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/e/74e4fad4ac2f4398597d8511e555b7ae481c1bef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^4-2x^2+1+x^2-1=2x-x^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"252\" height=\"16\" />. Simplifying this and moving all of the terms to one side gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/e/81e7bc5ca25ef6eec574155e0c434cc0fb17417e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^4-2x=0$\" width=\"92\" height=\"15\" />, and since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/4/5141b3b0adedf8965c49060e697689e88f77f6b8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x\\not=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"43\" height=\"17\" />, we can divide by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/5/335eb6e69367ffd2d3fc5bff48962af4b240a8eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^3-2=0$\" width=\"82\" height=\"15\" />, from which we find that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/2/7e2c1a236c3165e1a31276047682ea66af851d83.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\sqrt[3]{2}, \\boxed{\\text{C}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"91\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Pi_Academy\">Video Solution by Pi Academy</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Pi Academy\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/fZAChuJDlSw?si=wJUPmgVRlYwazauh\">https://youtu.be/fZAChuJDlSw?si=wJUPmgVRlYwazauh</a>\n</p><p>~ SmartSchoolBoy9, Out\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME\" title=\"1984 AHSME\">1984 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1984 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1984\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">Problem 26</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">Problem 28</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">26</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">27</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">28</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">29</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">30</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AHSME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AHSME Problems and Solutions\"> All AHSME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017174514\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.050 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.092 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 242/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2494/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 152/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 6830/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   15.226      1 -total\n 58.69%    8.936      1 Template:AHSME_box\n 37.78%    5.752      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:9768:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017174514 and revision id 236753. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}